<slide>
<title>AST is converted to bytecode (with tricks)</title>

<blurb>Code:</blurb>
<example inline="1"><![CDATA[&lt?php
*$a* |00cc00|=| |0000cc|8| |cc00cc|+| |0000cc|42|;
]]></example>

<blurb>AST:</blurb>
<example inline="1">0: |00cc00|AST_ASSIGN|
    var: *AST_VAR*
        name: "a"
    expr: AST_BINARY_OP
        flags: |cc00cc|BINARY_ADD (1)|
        left: |0000cc|8|
        right: |0000cc|42|
</example>

<blurb>Opcodes:</blurb>
<example inline="1">
compiled vars:  *!0 = $a*
line     #* E I O op              operands
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    2     0  E >   EXT_STMT            
          1        |00cc00|ASSIGN|         *!0*, 50
    3     2      > RETURN         1
</example>
